    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Email Enquiries Only\r\n\r\nEoin O’Neill Property Advisers are delighted to present this bright and spacious semi-detached dormer bungalow, ideally located on a mature, tree-lined residential street.\r\n\r\nThe property has generous off-street parking for up to three cars. The entrance hall leads to a large living and dining room which runs the full width of the house. The kitchen has a separate breakfast area and direct access to the private south-facing rear garden. The garden is well maintained and also has a dedicated area for growing fruit and vegetables.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises one double bedroom and the main bathroom. Upstairs are two further bedrooms, one large double and one single, and useful attic storage.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a large side garage with a utility area, providing excellent additional space for storage, a home gym or workshop.\r\n\r\nFurther features include gas-fired central heating, an alarm system and a D2 BER rating.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Dundrum Town Centre, the LUAS, M50, a selection of schools and a range of shops, cafés and other amenities all close by. The property is also well served by a number of parks and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nEmail enquiries only. Please include full details with your enquiry. Due to the high level of interest, it may not be possible to respond to all enquiries."
      },
      {
